WEBVTT

00:00:13.270 --> 00:00:15.730
Once upon a time, in a faraway kingdom,

00:00:15.730 --> 00:00:19.310
there was a beautiful and kindhearted princess.

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:21.440
However, the princess was
driven from the kingdom,

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:24.400
and made her way to a small island.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:29.520
There, she found a very old giant
statue that was made out of stone.

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:32.520
When the princess was being
set upon by pursuers, the giant,

00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:34.810
which was thought to be just a statue,

00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:38.350
suddenly sprang to life
and protected the princess.

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:42.940
The princess's pure heart
had spurred the giant to action.

00:00:42.940 --> 00:00:46.100
The princess set out for
her own home with the giant,

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:49.480
and ended up taking back her kingdom.

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:55.900
That is the "Legend of the Princess
and the Giant," told since times of yore.

00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:59.230
And the island where the princess is
said to have encountered the giant...

00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:59.230
Take this, you <i>moru-moru</i> fiend!

00:00:59.230 --> 00:01:01.310
That's cold <i>moru</i> !

00:00:59.230 --> 00:01:01.310
...is this one: Juin Island!

00:01:01.310 --> 00:01:03.940
Hey, are you listening to me?!

00:01:03.940 --> 00:01:07.440
Deflotte, I'm telling this story for your sake!

00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:11.690
Sorry, sorry. But here we are,
at the beach during the summer.

00:01:11.690 --> 00:01:13.980
Marius, you should go get undressed, too.

00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:17.900
Wha--?! H-How can I do that?!

00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:19.480
Deflotte...

00:01:19.480 --> 00:01:22.850
That's enough of that.
We didn't come here for the fun of it.

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:25.560
Huh? Then what <i>are</i> we here for?

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:28.770
I told you, we're here at Georg's request.

00:01:28.770 --> 00:01:31.690
A young woman claiming to be
the missing Princess Marielle

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:34.690
has turned up here on Juin Island. Moreover,

00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:40.730
Marielle! Marielle! Marielle!

00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:38.100
a volunteer army centered
around the princess has formed,

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:40.730
and apparently, their numbers are
growing steadily.

00:01:44.350 --> 00:01:48.690
Princess Marielle,
it is nearly time for your address.

00:01:48.690 --> 00:01:49.690
Right.

00:01:51.520 --> 00:01:54.480
I will go fulfill my duty to lead the people.

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:31.900
Members of the volunteer army
and those who wish to be,

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:35.400
Princess Marielle will be here shortly.

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:35.520
"Volunteer army leader"
"Jim McNeil"

00:03:37.810 --> 00:03:40.230
She's ridiculously popular.

00:03:40.230 --> 00:03:42.310
Maybe she is the real deal.

00:03:42.310 --> 00:03:43.940
I guess we'll see.

00:03:43.940 --> 00:03:45.940
She seems to have some popularity.

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:50.980
It's nothing for you to worry over <i>moru</i> .

00:03:50.980 --> 00:03:52.350
It's not that.

00:03:53.980 --> 00:03:57.560
How long am I going to have to remain like this?

00:03:57.560 --> 00:04:00.940
Adelheid is searching for me, too.

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:03.690
If only I could tell everyone the truth...

00:04:03.690 --> 00:04:04.850
<i>Moru</i> ...

00:04:04.850 --> 00:04:07.020
There's no rush.

00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:11.100
No matter what decision you reach,
we will protect you with everything we have.

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:14.020
You don't have to decide until
you've given it plenty of thought.

00:04:16.350 --> 00:04:19.650
I have to make my resolve.

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:22.270
The whole commotion over
this imposter is really on me,

00:04:22.270 --> 00:04:25.230
Marielle! Marielle!

00:04:22.270 --> 00:04:25.230
for hiding my true identity from everyone.

00:04:25.230 --> 00:04:28.980
Marielle! Marielle! Marielle!

00:04:28.980 --> 00:04:33.350
Yoo-hoo! It's your princess, Marielle!

00:04:40.770 --> 00:04:43.980
I see we have a lot of people here today.

00:04:43.980 --> 00:04:47.190
First of all... there are those
from the volunteer army!

00:04:47.190 --> 00:04:49.810
Yeah!

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:53.350
And also, those who want to be...
in the volunteer army!

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:54.770
Yeah!

00:04:54.770 --> 00:04:56.850
Y-Yeah...

00:04:56.850 --> 00:04:59.020
Yoo-hoo...

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:02.190
Listen up, everyone!
Between the war, the monsters,

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:06.770
and dreadful diseases going around,
everyone is growing ever more anxious.

00:05:06.770 --> 00:05:09.520
And yet the Orthodox Church
pretends not to notice.

00:05:09.520 --> 00:05:11.850
There's no way we can let that stand!

00:05:11.850 --> 00:05:14.270
Come on, let's all unite ourselves together

00:05:14.270 --> 00:05:19.730
and defend Juin Island from the
Orthodox Church that only does awful things!

00:05:19.730 --> 00:05:21.350
So that's Princess Marielle?

00:05:21.350 --> 00:05:23.190
The hell she is.

00:05:23.190 --> 00:05:24.440
Here, watch this!

00:05:24.440 --> 00:05:26.190
Taking upon itself all of your dreams,

00:05:26.190 --> 00:05:29.270
the legendary giant will now go into motion!

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:33.310
The legend of the giant is for real <i>moru</i> !

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:34.940
Don't be ridiculous.

00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:37.230
That's a fake, any way you slice it.

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:47.900
That's all for today's gathering.

00:05:47.900 --> 00:05:50.600
See you later, everyone!

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:52.730
Marielle! Marielle! Marielle!

00:05:52.730 --> 00:05:55.850
Well, I had a feeling it was something like this.

00:05:55.850 --> 00:05:56.900
Ready to leave?

00:05:56.900 --> 00:05:57.900
Yeah.

00:05:59.190 --> 00:06:00.190
Marius?

00:06:01.400 --> 00:06:03.940
How could Princess Marielle be as ridiculous as that?!

00:06:03.940 --> 00:06:06.270
I'm putting a stop to this this instant!

00:06:10.690 --> 00:06:14.270
That was another terrific
performance today, Princess Marielle.

00:06:14.270 --> 00:06:18.770
Thanks to you, new applicants
are thronging to our volunteer army.

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:21.230
The peace and safety of Juin Island is assured.

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:27.900
Are you tired? Maybe you should get some rest.

00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:32.440
I'll take care of everything from here.

00:06:32.440 --> 00:06:33.520
I...

00:06:33.520 --> 00:06:35.600
Princess Marielle!

00:06:35.600 --> 00:06:37.230
We bring word!

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:38.440
Has something happened?

00:06:38.440 --> 00:06:39.270
Yes.

00:06:39.270 --> 00:06:42.770
The Orthodox Church has started
cracking down all throughout Hortensia,

00:06:42.770 --> 00:06:45.940
searching for Princess Marielle
under the guise of a witch hunt.

00:06:45.940 --> 00:06:46.900
What?

00:06:46.900 --> 00:06:52.020
If they find out that the real princess is here...

00:06:52.020 --> 00:06:54.600
Princess! Now is the time for us to strike back!

00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:55.600
Huh?

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:59.060
Let's call on the people who support you,
and charge into the capital!

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:01.940
We'll overthrow that despicable Orthodox Church!

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:03.310
Well, you see...

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:05.810
Let's take back true freedom!

00:07:05.810 --> 00:07:08.980
Well sure, I do want to be free...

00:07:08.980 --> 00:07:11.480
Oh! The princess has made her decision!

00:07:11.480 --> 00:07:12.980
The time has come at last!

00:07:11.480 --> 00:07:12.980
Huh? No...

00:07:12.980 --> 00:07:14.770
Whoa, hold on a minute, people!

00:07:12.980 --> 00:07:14.770
Yeah, let's do this!

00:07:14.770 --> 00:07:16.060
Let's go discuss our strategy!

00:07:16.060 --> 00:07:18.150
We have to let everybody know!

00:07:18.150 --> 00:07:20.400
Freedom! Freedom! Freedom!

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:24.100
Jim, what do we do?
If they advance on the capital...

00:07:24.100 --> 00:07:25.810
Yeah, I know.

00:07:27.310 --> 00:07:30.520
I'll go talk everyone down.
You go on back to your room.

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:44.100
We've finally arrived.

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:47.100
It was a lot of work to get here.

00:07:47.100 --> 00:07:52.020
Thalia, you kept saying you wanted
to see the legendary giant.

00:07:52.020 --> 00:07:53.810
You're the one who said so, Elva.

00:07:53.810 --> 00:07:56.060
I never said that.

00:07:56.060 --> 00:07:58.730
Right now, it's <i>my</i> turn to be right.

00:07:58.730 --> 00:08:00.980
Okay, I said it, then.

00:08:00.980 --> 00:08:05.810
Say, do you think the princess and
the giant are real? Or are they fakes?

00:08:05.810 --> 00:08:08.190
Either way is fine with me.

00:08:08.190 --> 00:08:10.850
If they're real, we'll take them back with us.

00:08:10.850 --> 00:08:13.190
And if they're fake, we can destroy them.

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:27.150
How long do I have to keep this up?

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:30.190
Found you!

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:31.980
Huh?! Who are you?!

00:08:31.980 --> 00:08:34.600
Say your prayers, you big fake!

00:08:34.600 --> 00:08:37.770
I am Alfred, lord of Albert.

00:08:37.770 --> 00:08:40.060
By order of the captain of the Ecclesiastical Order,

00:08:40.060 --> 00:08:43.810
I am here to investigate the woman
who claims to be Princess Marielle.

00:08:43.810 --> 00:08:46.270
We know that you are a fake.

00:08:46.270 --> 00:08:47.310
Don't bother resisting--

00:08:47.310 --> 00:08:49.440
I'm sorry!

00:08:49.440 --> 00:08:55.100
I never imagined things would
end up the way they have.

00:08:55.100 --> 00:08:57.770
It sounds like there's some sort
of reason behind all of this.

00:09:00.980 --> 00:09:03.310
What is your real name?

00:09:03.310 --> 00:09:04.600
Marie.

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:05.850
Marie,

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:09.940
would you mind telling me why you
are pretending to be Princess Marielle?

00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:15.520
It started out just being a game.

00:09:16.850 --> 00:09:19.100
Jim, a childhood friend of mine,

00:09:19.100 --> 00:09:20.900
would pretend we were a princess and knight.

00:09:20.900 --> 00:09:24.310
Jim, is it true that monsters
have appeared again?

00:09:24.310 --> 00:09:27.810
Yeah. The village was attacked,
and some people were hurt.

00:09:27.810 --> 00:09:32.150
Ever since the princess went missing,
things have really gotten rough, huh?

00:09:33.770 --> 00:09:37.690
It's all right. I'll keep you safe.

00:09:37.690 --> 00:09:41.310
Sure. You are my knight captain, after all.

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:44.850
Do you want to play that again,
for old time's sake?

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:45.850
Mm-hmm.

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:51.230
I haven't seen them around.

00:09:56.310 --> 00:09:57.600
Who is that?

00:09:59.560 --> 00:10:01.980
One royal milk tea.

00:10:01.980 --> 00:10:04.560
As you wish, Princess Marielle.

00:10:04.560 --> 00:10:05.560
Princess?!

00:10:07.020 --> 00:10:10.230
Are you the princess that
got driven out of the capital?

00:10:10.230 --> 00:10:12.690
Marielle, Princess of Hortensia?

00:10:12.690 --> 00:10:15.440
Huh? We were just playing around...

00:10:17.690 --> 00:10:21.850
We want to keep our families
and friends safe from the monsters.

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:26.230
But the labor and taxes imposed on us
by the Orthodox Church are so harsh...

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:29.940
The way things are going,
the island will be wiped out before long.

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:32.520
The island needs hope!

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:37.980
Tell us, mister, this lady is
Princess Marielle, right?

00:10:37.980 --> 00:10:40.060
Well, actually...

00:10:40.060 --> 00:10:41.060
Jim...

00:10:44.270 --> 00:10:48.480
I didn't think it would become
this overblown when we started.

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:54.150
But word that Princess Marielle was leading
a revolt against the Orthodox Church

00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:56.400
soon spread beyond the island,

00:10:56.400 --> 00:10:58.770
and people quickly began gathering.

00:10:58.770 --> 00:11:01.770
And by that point, you were already committed.

00:11:01.770 --> 00:11:02.770
Mm-hmm.

00:11:03.900 --> 00:11:06.940
I don't want to continue the lie any longer.

00:11:06.940 --> 00:11:10.940
But I'm too afraid of
disappointing everyone, too.

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:13.770
I don't know what to do now.

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:16.270
I kind of feel sorry for you <i>moru</i> .

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:19.850
It's all right, Marie.

00:11:19.850 --> 00:11:22.190
I'm going to help you.

00:11:24.520 --> 00:11:28.730
Hey now, that's an awfully different
attitude than you had a moment ago.

00:11:28.730 --> 00:11:33.690
She's been denying who she is,
and the weight of it is suffocating her.

00:11:33.690 --> 00:11:36.100
Marie...

00:11:36.100 --> 00:11:38.850
You should reveal who you are
to everyone as soon as possible.

00:11:38.850 --> 00:11:41.480
Wh-What are you talking about, Alfred?!

00:11:41.480 --> 00:11:43.770
It's to protect Marie from the witch hunt.

00:11:43.770 --> 00:11:46.230
You think this will be that easy?!

00:11:46.230 --> 00:11:48.690
She shoulders the people's
hopes as their princess!

00:11:48.690 --> 00:11:53.310
It's true, with as much hope as they're
placing in her, this could turn ugly.

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:57.230
Even so, nothing good can come of
continuously hiding one's true identity.

00:11:57.230 --> 00:12:01.150
I know... I know it can't!

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:02.440
But...

00:12:02.440 --> 00:12:04.400
Marius?

00:12:04.400 --> 00:12:05.690
Marie!

00:12:05.690 --> 00:12:07.400
I don't think I can stop them!

00:12:07.400 --> 00:12:08.770
Jim!

00:12:08.770 --> 00:12:10.190
Who are you people?!

00:12:10.190 --> 00:12:12.270
Get away from Princess Marielle!

00:12:12.270 --> 00:12:12.920
What's this?!

00:12:12.920 --> 00:12:13.940
Intruders?!

00:12:13.940 --> 00:12:15.480
Why, you...!

00:12:15.480 --> 00:12:16.170
Run!

00:12:16.170 --> 00:12:16.980
Huh?!

00:12:18.650 --> 00:12:19.650
Marie!

00:12:41.060 --> 00:12:43.150
We don't wish to fight with you!

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:46.310
You expect me to believe that,
you minions of the Orthodox Church?!

00:12:49.100 --> 00:12:50.980
You're here to arrest the princess, aren't you?!

00:12:50.980 --> 00:12:53.310
We can't let you leave here alive!

00:12:53.310 --> 00:12:55.600
With your skill level,

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:58.230
I doubt you have much chance of winning.

00:12:58.230 --> 00:13:01.100
Shut up! I'm going to keep the princess safe!

00:13:01.100 --> 00:13:03.350
Haven't you realized it yet?

00:13:03.350 --> 00:13:04.440
Realized what?

00:13:04.440 --> 00:13:08.060
That Marie is being tormented
by lying about who she really is!

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:19.940
We should be safe here.

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:20.940
Yeah.

00:13:22.020 --> 00:13:25.020
So, you're Marius, are you?

00:13:25.020 --> 00:13:27.900
Why did you say you would help me?

00:13:28.900 --> 00:13:32.270
I don't see you as a stranger.

00:13:32.270 --> 00:13:36.400
I-I mean, "Marie" and "Marius"
are pretty similar, aren't they?

00:13:36.400 --> 00:13:39.730
And I have to ask, what's up with that Jim guy?

00:13:39.730 --> 00:13:41.940
How can a close friend like him
not know how you feel

00:13:41.940 --> 00:13:44.730
and just go on pretending
to be a volunteer army leader?

00:13:44.730 --> 00:13:46.100
He's incorrigible <i>moru</i> !

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:48.520
N-No, he's not!

00:13:48.520 --> 00:13:52.730
Jim is thinking about me more than anyone else.

00:13:52.730 --> 00:13:55.100
The whole reason I became a princess...

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:57.270
...was out of something he did for me.

00:13:57.270 --> 00:13:59.150
Marie...?

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:02.190
I was orphaned as a child,

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:05.190
and growing up, all I ever did was cry.

00:14:08.020 --> 00:14:09.810
Marie, don't cry.

00:14:11.650 --> 00:14:13.270
Jim?

00:14:13.270 --> 00:14:16.770
Let's make believe something
that will be fun together.

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:43.690
You look very pretty today,
as always, Princess Marielle.

00:14:46.350 --> 00:14:50.100
Thank you, Royal Order Captain Jim.

00:14:50.100 --> 00:14:52.980
You really do look better with a smile, Marie.

00:14:54.270 --> 00:14:57.600
I will preserve your smile forever.

00:14:59.690 --> 00:15:02.980
Now I get it. This game of "Princess and Knight"

00:15:02.980 --> 00:15:05.480
was one that you started for Marie's sake.

00:15:06.900 --> 00:15:10.400
Why are you still having her
play the princess now?

00:15:10.400 --> 00:15:12.810
The volunteer army is made up of those

00:15:12.810 --> 00:15:15.980
who are being oppressed by the Orthodox Church.

00:15:15.980 --> 00:15:19.350
To them, the princess is
the very object of their hope.

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:21.980
There's no way we can take that away from them.

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:28.850
Are they the ones that
you really want to protect?

00:15:28.850 --> 00:15:32.650
Are you really going to allow the one
closest to you to go on suffering?

00:15:35.810 --> 00:15:39.730
Right now, the people in the
volunteer army are our good friends.

00:15:41.480 --> 00:15:43.980
If they find out at this point
that we've been untruthful...

00:15:46.150 --> 00:15:51.350
Marie, as it happens, I, too,
have something I'm hiding from my friends.

00:15:51.350 --> 00:15:54.480
Huh? What in the world would you be--

00:15:54.480 --> 00:15:56.520
Oh, never mind, I'm sorry.

00:15:56.520 --> 00:15:59.600
I shouldn't be asking about something
you can't even tell your friends.

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:04.980
Not being truthful to the people
you care most about...

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:10.350
...is harder... than anything.

00:16:15.060 --> 00:16:16.350
I've decided!

00:16:16.350 --> 00:16:19.480
I <i>am</i> going to tell everyone the truth!

00:16:19.480 --> 00:16:20.690
Marie...

00:16:20.690 --> 00:16:22.850
Once I explain it to Jim, I'm sure he will--

00:16:22.850 --> 00:16:23.850
Marie!

00:16:24.900 --> 00:16:26.100
Jim...

00:16:26.100 --> 00:16:28.350
I knew you'd be here.

00:16:28.350 --> 00:16:30.230
Listen, Jim, I--

00:16:30.230 --> 00:16:33.810
Marie... let's reveal the truth to everyone.

00:16:33.810 --> 00:16:35.100
Are you sure?

00:16:35.100 --> 00:16:36.310
Yeah.

00:16:36.310 --> 00:16:39.020
I'm sure things will work out.

00:16:39.020 --> 00:16:41.600
Will you break the news with me, Marie?

00:16:43.190 --> 00:16:44.190
Mm-hmm!

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:51.940
Why are we having an emergency meeting?

00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:54.440
I'll bet it's a rally to march on the capital.

00:16:54.440 --> 00:16:55.690
Oh, here they are.

00:16:57.400 --> 00:17:00.850
Everyone, thanks for coming
together on such short notice.

00:17:00.850 --> 00:17:04.980
Jim and I have an important
announcement to make to all of you.

00:17:08.150 --> 00:17:10.850
Everyone, we are terribly sorry.

00:17:10.850 --> 00:17:15.230
The truth is, I'm not really the princess.

00:17:15.230 --> 00:17:16.980
I really am sorry!

00:17:21.940 --> 00:17:22.940
<i>Moru</i> ...

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:26.270
Not really her?

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:27.560
She's a fake?

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:29.310
That can't be...

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:33.440
This giant is also a fake.
Jim was always the one who made it move.

00:17:33.440 --> 00:17:35.190
They've been tricking us?!

00:17:35.190 --> 00:17:36.650
That's a terrible betrayal!

00:17:36.650 --> 00:17:38.730
Hey! Say something!

00:17:38.730 --> 00:17:39.690
What gives?!

00:17:39.690 --> 00:17:40.600
Why'd you do it?!

00:17:40.600 --> 00:17:42.100
What's the big idea?!

00:17:42.100 --> 00:17:43.190
Hey!

00:17:43.190 --> 00:17:45.230
Marius!

00:17:45.230 --> 00:17:47.980
It's just... this is all so...

00:17:47.980 --> 00:17:48.900
Come off it!

00:17:48.900 --> 00:17:50.310
Hey! Answer us!

00:17:56.150 --> 00:17:58.020
The giant has started to move!

00:17:58.020 --> 00:17:59.690
What's going on?!

00:17:59.690 --> 00:18:00.730
Watch out!

00:18:05.980 --> 00:18:07.230
Marie! Marie!

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:08.980
What do you know?

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:12.230
The princess and the giant are both fakes.

00:18:12.230 --> 00:18:13.770
You two!

00:18:13.770 --> 00:18:17.020
Ah, mister! We meet again!

00:18:17.020 --> 00:18:19.190
Come on, let's...

00:18:19.190 --> 00:18:21.400
...play a game together!

00:18:23.150 --> 00:18:24.190
Oh, no!

00:18:24.190 --> 00:18:25.100
Monsters!

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:26.100
Run!

00:18:26.980 --> 00:18:28.020
Stop it!

00:18:30.560 --> 00:18:32.980
This way! Hurry! Run!

00:18:34.600 --> 00:18:37.310
Given the chance, I'd rather be saving pretty girls!

00:18:37.310 --> 00:18:38.810
Protect Marie!

00:18:38.810 --> 00:18:39.810
Right!

00:18:42.400 --> 00:18:43.230
The princess!

00:18:43.230 --> 00:18:44.770
Not anymore, she isn't!

00:18:44.770 --> 00:18:45.810
Damn it...

00:18:45.810 --> 00:18:47.350
Do we just run away?

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:54.650
Are you all right, Jim?!

00:18:54.650 --> 00:18:56.690
Thanks to Alfred and the others,

00:18:56.690 --> 00:18:59.310
I remembered what was most important.

00:19:01.150 --> 00:19:05.770
Marie, I've always wanted you to keep smiling.

00:19:05.770 --> 00:19:11.270
Despite that, I've been making you suffer
for a long time, and I'm really sorry.

00:19:12.150 --> 00:19:14.100
Jim...

00:19:14.100 --> 00:19:18.980
I'm going to preserve
your smile this time for good!

00:19:18.980 --> 00:19:20.520
Not just you, Jim!

00:19:21.270 --> 00:19:24.020
We've all been saved by her smile!

00:19:24.020 --> 00:19:27.150
We want to stick with you, Marie.

00:19:27.150 --> 00:19:28.150
Guys...

00:19:35.350 --> 00:19:36.350
Now!

00:19:42.940 --> 00:19:45.150
Marius! Get out of there!

00:19:45.150 --> 00:19:46.520
Oh, no!

00:19:58.650 --> 00:19:59.850
What the...?

00:20:10.150 --> 00:20:11.650
Marius, hurry!

00:20:16.560 --> 00:20:19.150
Say, was that the Magonian...

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:20.190
It couldn't be.

00:20:20.190 --> 00:20:21.350
But...

00:20:21.350 --> 00:20:23.900
It's my turn to be right now, remember?

00:20:23.900 --> 00:20:25.560
Hmm...

00:20:25.560 --> 00:20:28.480
Aw, this isn't as much fun anymore.

00:20:28.480 --> 00:20:29.940
Should we leave, then?

00:20:29.940 --> 00:20:31.770
Mm-hmm, let's leave.

00:20:39.060 --> 00:20:42.650
Marius, and the rest of you,
thanks so much for everything.

00:20:42.650 --> 00:20:45.850
Thanks to you, everyone on
the island came through safely.

00:20:45.850 --> 00:20:49.230
Our friends in the volunteer
army have forgiven us,

00:20:49.230 --> 00:20:53.810
and we've decided to make a fresh start
as the island's community watch.

00:20:53.810 --> 00:20:56.060
We were just carrying out our mission.

00:20:56.060 --> 00:20:59.980
We'll be sure to put in a good word
for you in our report to the captain.

00:20:59.980 --> 00:21:01.440
Thanks.

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:03.810
I promise, we'll make sure
to pay you back for this someday.

00:21:03.810 --> 00:21:06.600
Yeah, we'll be looking forward to it.

00:21:08.980 --> 00:21:13.520
The question remains, though,
what happened with that rock yesterday?

00:21:13.520 --> 00:21:15.980
I can't say it <i>didn't</i> look like a person...

00:21:18.190 --> 00:21:19.600
But it couldn't be.

00:21:20.230 --> 00:21:23.770
Also, if you ever do run into her,
I want you to tell her something.

00:21:23.770 --> 00:21:27.980
"Whenever you're in trouble,
I promise, I'll come running to your aid.

00:21:27.980 --> 00:21:32.900
So don't worry about overdoing things,"
by the Fake Princess Marielle.

00:21:34.810 --> 00:21:36.150
Marie...

00:21:36.150 --> 00:21:38.270
I know how hard it was for me,

00:21:38.270 --> 00:21:41.150
so it figures that the real
princess has it even harder.

00:21:41.150 --> 00:21:43.690
Mm-hmm, I'll be sure to tell her.

00:21:43.690 --> 00:21:45.020
And that means

00:21:45.020 --> 00:21:50.020
you have to make certain you find
the real missing Princess Marielle, okay?

00:21:50.020 --> 00:21:52.400
Mm-hmm, that's a promise.

00:21:54.270 --> 00:21:56.400
Someday, for sure.

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:02.090
Chapter 6

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:02.090
True or False

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:02.090
~The Burden of a Princess~

00:23:33.560 --> 00:23:35.520
It wouldn't suddenly become a ghost town.

00:23:35.520 --> 00:23:37.230
I <i>do</i> fear the Orthodox Church.

00:23:37.230 --> 00:23:38.730
You disappoint me, Alfred.

00:23:38.730 --> 00:23:41.350
These aren't the same as
the ones from Petale Village.

00:23:41.350 --> 00:23:42.690
<i>Former</i> priest?

00:23:42.690 --> 00:23:46.940
I'll tell you exactly what the
Orthodox Church is doing in this village.

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:47.070
Chapter 7

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:47.070
Dilemma

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:47.070
~A Truth Revealed~
